# Keep this file conservative. Because app/Dockerfile does `COPY . .` from the
# repository root, anything excluded here is invisible to the build, and an
# excluded source file makes the COPY layer digest stay identical across a real
# change, so the layer is served from cache and the binary silently keeps the
# old code. Never add a pattern that can match Go sources or app/api/docs.

# Git
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Docs and research (app/api/docs is generated Swagger and IS needed by the build)
**/README.md
CHANGELOG.md
LICENSE
reports
research_notes

# Docker and CI
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
.dockerignore
.github

# Editors
.vscode
.idea

# Build artifacts
**/bin/
dist/
build/
**/tmp/
temp/
*.exe

# Test and coverage output
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Secrets: these must never reach an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
